2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (A\040survey\040on\040coverage\040path\040planning\040for\040robotics)
/Author (Enric\040Galceran\054\040Marc\040Carreras)
/Subject (Coverage\040Path\040Planning\040\050CPP\051\040is\040the\040task\040of\040determining\040a\040path\040that\040passes\040over\040all\040points\040of\040an\040area\040or\040volume\040of\040interest\040while\040avoiding\040obstacles\056\040This\040task\040is\040integral\040to\040many\040robotic\040applications\054\040such\040as\040vacuum\040cleaning\040robots\054\040painter\040robots\054\040autonomous\040underwater\040vehicles\040creating\040image\040mosaics\054\040demining\040robots\054\040lawn\040mowers\054\040automated\040harvesters\054\040window\040cleaners\040and\040inspection\040of\040complex\040structures\054\040just\040to\040name\040a\040few\056\040A\040considerable\040body\040of\040research\040has\040addressed\040the\040CPP\040problem\056\040However\054\040no\040updated\040surveys\040on\040CPP\040reflecting\040recent\040advances\040in\040the\040field\040have\040been\040presented\040in\040the\040past\040ten\040years\056\040In\040this\040paper\054\040we\040present\040a\040review\040of\040the\040most\040successful\040CPP\040methods\054\040focusing\040on\040the\040achievements\040made\040in\040the\040past\040decade\056\040Furthermore\054\040we\040discuss\040reported\040field\040applications\040of\040the\040described\040CPP\040methods\056\040This\040work\040aims\040to\040become\040a\040starting\040point\040for\040researchers\040who\040are\040initiating\040their\040endeavors\040in\040CPP\056\040Likewise\054\040this\040work\040aims\040to\040present\040a\040comprehensive\040review\040of\040the\040recent\040breakthroughs\040in\040the\040field\054\040providing\040links\040to\040the\040most\040interesting\040and\040successful\040works\056)
/Keywords (01\040Dec\0402013\054\040Robotics\040and\040Autonomous\040Systems\054\040University\040of\040Girona)
>>
endobj
